*** Keywords ***

CB007873-HA-5
    [Documentation]     start a multiUE set up with UE list done in parameter
    ...                 Cell_setup NSA 2 cells (1 FDD + 1 TDD)
    ...                 All ue register are done in one step according ${UEList} list order
    ...                 All PDU Session are set  in one step according ${UEList} list order
    ...                 All traffic are stated   in one step according ${UEList} list order

    [Arguments]                     ${param}
	
    Init Sequence                   ${param}
    Critical Step    Restart TL
    Critical Step    Cell_Setup_NSA_2_Cells_1FDD_1TDD
    Step             4G_Attach_FDD_CA_Capable
    Step             SG_Attach_FDD_CA_Capable                             depends=4G_Attach_FDD_CA_Capable
    Step             Check_sCellToAddModList_onegateLogs                  depends=SG_Attach_FDD_CA_Capable 
    Step             Traffic_DL_UL_NSA_FDD_CA_Capable                     depends=Check_sCellToAddModList_onegateLogs
	[Teardown]       Teardown CB007873_HA-5

Teardown CB007873_HA-5
    [Documentation]    collect Sos Report if a TC is failed or if the user need traces ForceDebugDataCollection
    Dated log                       Teardown for CB007873_HA-5
    Run Keyword If                  ${ForceDebugDataCollection}   Get Sos Report
    [Teardown]                      GenericTest.Display diagnosis
    